WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 16=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

02:11.800 --> 02:12.680
Young Lady.

02:12.759 --> 02:13.799
I've finished applying it.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.000
Come and sit down.

02:18.808 --> 02:20.350
- Young Lady...
- Sit right here.

02:20.360 --> 02:21.720
Don't go anywhere

02:22.159 --> 02:23.359
until I come back.

02:23.879 --> 02:24.799
Young Lady.

03:36.520 --> 03:39.759
I thought I'd keep trying,

03:40.024 --> 03:42.070
and once I'd earned merit
and been promoted,

03:43.240 --> 03:46.239
I'd have the nerve
to come and ask for your hand.

03:48.560 --> 03:50.239
But he's a marquis.

03:51.360 --> 03:52.639
No matter how hard I try

03:52.960 --> 03:55.280
for the rest of my life,
I can never measure up to him.

03:57.280 --> 03:58.400
I...

03:59.360 --> 04:00.959
I'm not worthy of you.

04:05.080 --> 04:06.239
Zheng.

04:06.599 --> 04:08.479
Don't say that.

04:11.080 --> 04:13.199
I don't care whether
we're well matched or not.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.720
I only want to marry you.

04:19.720 --> 04:22.759
Someday, when you see other young ladies

04:23.224 --> 04:25.432
become the wives
of high-ranking officials,

04:25.959 --> 04:27.639
you'll regret it.

04:34.199 --> 04:35.560
Never.

04:37.360 --> 04:39.599
I'm not like other young ladies.

04:39.600 --> 04:42.480
I don't care
about family status or rank.

04:48.560 --> 04:50.040
Zheng.

04:50.160 --> 04:51.279
I...

04:51.519 --> 04:54.000
I only want to marry you.

07:40.000 --> 07:43.159
We share in both honor and disgrace.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.839
She's your second sister.

07:46.399 --> 07:47.838
If her reputation is ruined,

07:47.839 --> 07:49.279
yours will suffer, too.

08:03.759 --> 08:04.759
Young...

08:10.360 --> 08:11.320
Sit down.

08:13.759 --> 08:14.959
These clothes...

08:16.439 --> 08:18.159
I've never left.

08:18.399 --> 08:21.040
We've been playing in
the pavilion together the whole time.

08:30.199 --> 08:31.480
No cheating.

08:31.639 --> 08:33.479
You lost, so you
have to bark like a dog.

08:34.200 --> 08:35.320
Hurry.

08:35.519 --> 08:37.199
Hurry and bark.

08:38.919 --> 08:41.199
Woof, woof.

08:42.600 --> 08:43.800
Louder.

08:45.799 --> 08:46.999
Louder.

08:47.039 --> 08:49.280
Woof.

08:50.639 --> 08:52.038
Keep barking as you go.

08:52.039 --> 08:53.560
You can't stop until I say so.

08:55.240 --> 08:58.040
Woof.

08:58.360 --> 08:59.160
Woof.

09:01.000 --> 09:01.959
Woof.

09:03.919 --> 09:05.040
Woof, woof.

09:08.639 --> 09:09.640
Woof.

09:14.799 --> 09:15.719
I'll go first.

09:17.759 --> 09:19.239
Once I've tricked them into leaving,

09:19.240 --> 09:20.440
you can go.

09:23.360 --> 09:24.440
Xiuwan.

09:37.279 --> 09:38.400
Woof, woof.

09:39.600 --> 09:40.839
Woof.

09:42.120 --> 09:42.920
Woof.

09:43.559 --> 09:44.359
Woof.

09:46.759 --> 09:47.879
Woof, woof.

09:59.519 --> 10:01.079
- Xiuwan.
- Second Young Lady.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.950
You're a young lady
from a respectable family,

10:04.960 --> 10:06.760
yet you're making
a maid bark like a dog.

10:07.559 --> 10:08.719
How improper.

10:13.279 --> 10:14.999
Just look at yourself.

10:15.120 --> 10:16.839
No one in this residence mistreats you.

10:16.840 --> 10:18.120
Yet you're timid all day long,

10:18.130 --> 10:20.870
without any of the bearing of
a young lady from a respectable family.

10:25.960 --> 10:27.560
Where were you just now?

10:27.919 --> 10:31.359
Why didn't I see you when I came over?

10:32.000 --> 10:34.239
Tongcao and I were
in the pavilion on the hill,

10:34.240 --> 10:35.560
playing cat's cradle.

10:35.799 --> 10:38.839
We agreed that whoever
lost would bark like a dog.

10:45.840 --> 10:46.959
All right.

10:47.080 --> 10:48.560
I'm tired from walking around, too.

10:49.000 --> 10:50.839
Come back with me.

11:15.879 --> 11:17.239
What are you looking at?

11:19.879 --> 11:21.680
Cuique and Zheng

11:22.320 --> 11:24.959
are probably going to pay
their respects to First Madam.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.040
Should we stop them

11:27.639 --> 11:29.479
and tell them Xiushu is ill,

11:29.480 --> 11:31.400
so they don't disturb First Madam?

11:32.320 --> 11:34.119
Zheng once saved Jinqi's life.

11:34.120 --> 11:36.839
No matter how busy First Madam is,
she'll make time to see Zheng.

11:45.600 --> 11:47.999
Go wait quietly outside Zhichun Hall.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.079
As soon as Jinqi returns,

11:49.080 --> 11:50.520
come find me at once.

11:50.559 --> 11:51.760
Keep it quiet.

12:00.759 --> 12:01.640
Hurry.

12:03.799 --> 12:04.558
First Madam.

12:04.559 --> 12:05.920
Physician Li is here.

12:07.720 --> 12:08.959
First Madam Lin.

12:09.000 --> 12:09.950
I'm sorry to trouble you

12:09.960 --> 12:11.719
with two visits to Lin Residence

12:11.720 --> 12:12.839
in a single day.

12:12.840 --> 12:15.359
A physician's first concern
is his patients. It's only right.

12:17.120 --> 12:18.798
Xiushu took the medicine you prescribed,

12:18.799 --> 12:20.319
but instead of fading,

12:20.320 --> 12:21.959
the rash has gotten worse.

12:22.200 --> 12:24.400
She also feels a little feverish to me.

12:31.960 --> 12:33.158
It's erysipelas.

12:33.159 --> 12:34.400
Erysipelas?

12:34.440 --> 12:36.990
According to Treatise on the Origins
and Symptoms of Diseases,

12:37.048 --> 12:39.270
"Dan" refers to the skin
suddenly turning bright red,

12:39.279 --> 12:40.839
as if painted with cinnabar,

12:40.840 --> 12:42.199
hence the name "dan."

12:43.032 --> 12:45.240
When I saw her this morning,
it had just begun

12:45.288 --> 12:46.920
and looked very much like a pollen rash.

12:46.960 --> 12:49.760
Now that she has a headache and fever,

12:49.879 --> 12:51.280
it's clearly erysipelas.

12:51.799 --> 12:53.079
Is it serious?

12:53.279 --> 12:54.439
Don't worry, First Madam.

12:54.440 --> 12:57.079
As long as it's treated promptly,
she'll make a full recovery.

12:58.480 --> 12:59.959
I'll write a prescription first.

12:59.960 --> 13:01.079
Good, good, good.

13:10.340 --> 13:13.820
(Astragalus, Coptis,
Phellodendron, Licorice, Forsythia)

13:15.159 --> 13:16.400
Go get the medicine.

13:18.879 --> 13:20.439
Thank you, Physician Li.

13:20.440 --> 13:22.280
I'll take my leave.

13:22.679 --> 13:23.558
Madam Wu.

13:23.559 --> 13:25.119
See Physician Li out.

13:25.159 --> 13:25.920
Yes.

13:42.759 --> 13:43.558
Physician Li.

13:43.559 --> 13:44.719
I'll see you out.

13:45.759 --> 13:46.879
All right.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.199
Physician Li.

14:09.720 --> 14:11.479
I've been going in and out all day

14:11.480 --> 14:12.678
and exposed to the wind.

14:12.679 --> 14:15.040
Now I've developed
a slight red rash, too.

14:15.080 --> 14:17.599
Could I trouble you to take a look

14:17.600 --> 14:20.320
and see whether
it's a pollen rash or erysipelas?

14:21.080 --> 14:21.959
Let me see.

14:21.960 --> 14:23.079
Let me see.

14:25.279 --> 14:26.440
Take a look.

14:28.919 --> 14:30.079
Physician Li.

14:30.080 --> 14:31.320
Is this...

14:32.320 --> 14:33.959
Yes. It's erysipelas.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.160
It's erysipelas.

14:35.170 --> 14:37.918
Then I can use Fourth Young Lady's
prescription for my medicine, right?

14:37.919 --> 14:38.599
Yes.

14:38.600 --> 14:40.158
Yes, you can.

14:40.159 --> 14:42.040
Thank you, Physician Li.

14:42.080 --> 14:43.479
I just thought

14:43.480 --> 14:45.839
the sooner I take the medicine
and get it under control,

14:45.840 --> 14:48.040
the less likely it is
to interfere with my duties.

14:48.504 --> 14:50.790
I just remembered
I have something urgent to attend to.

14:50.799 --> 14:52.278
No need to see me out, Madam.

14:52.279 --> 14:54.719
- It's fine, Physician Li.
- No need. Really.

14:54.720 --> 14:55.479
Take care.

14:55.480 --> 14:56.350
No need to see me out.

14:56.360 --> 14:58.239
Physician Li. Watch your step.

14:59.840 --> 15:02.839
- Watch your step.
- Physician Li!

15:04.519 --> 15:05.640
Physician Li!

15:06.840 --> 15:07.918
Madam Wu.

15:07.919 --> 15:09.918
Young Master
has a few questions for Physician Li.

15:09.919 --> 15:11.719
I can see him out instead.

15:18.759 --> 15:19.999
Physician Li!

15:23.279 --> 15:24.400
Physician Li!

15:27.000 --> 15:28.160
Physician Li!

15:30.519 --> 15:31.720
After Yuchan took the medicine,

15:31.730 --> 15:32.952
she's been sleeping ever since.

15:32.960 --> 15:35.038
From what I can tell,
her fever hasn't gotten worse,

15:35.039 --> 15:36.239
but it hasn't gone down either.

15:36.240 --> 15:37.319
The rash on her body

15:37.320 --> 15:38.999
looks even more red and swollen.

15:39.480 --> 15:41.470
I really have
something urgent to attend to.

15:41.480 --> 15:42.680
Something urgent.

15:43.240 --> 15:44.359
Physician Li.

15:45.159 --> 15:46.280
Young Lady,

15:46.344 --> 15:48.344
illness comes swiftly,
but recovery takes time.

15:48.392 --> 15:50.070
What I prescribed
isn't some miracle cure.

15:50.080 --> 15:53.678
How could she recover
the moment she takes it? It takes time.

15:53.679 --> 15:54.839
But the swelling

15:54.840 --> 15:56.079
looks like it's about to burst.

15:56.080 --> 15:57.400
That's normal. It's normal.

15:57.416 --> 15:59.160
Once the heat is released,
she'll be fine.

15:59.208 --> 16:00.790
I have something urgent to attend to.

16:00.799 --> 16:02.558
Tomorrow. I'll definitely come tomorrow.

16:02.559 --> 16:03.599
I'll definitely come.

16:09.559 --> 16:11.680
We're hardly monsters.

16:11.919 --> 16:13.560
Why is he in such a panic?

16:28.120 --> 16:29.280
Madam Wu.

16:33.000 --> 16:34.160
Madam Wu.

16:34.279 --> 16:36.879
Why was Physician Li
called here twice today?

16:36.960 --> 16:39.079
Did Fourth Young Lady's
pollen rash get worse?

16:42.080 --> 16:44.158
You're a maid at Zhichun Hall.

16:44.159 --> 16:46.640
Your duty is to serve Young Master well.

16:47.159 --> 16:48.278
Look.

16:48.279 --> 16:50.079
The night curfew is about to begin.

16:50.080 --> 16:51.918
Young Master should be back by now,

16:51.919 --> 16:54.479
yet you're here asking
questions about everything.

16:54.679 --> 16:56.239
You have no sense of propriety.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.719
Thank you for the reminder, Madam.

16:58.960 --> 17:00.239
I'll remember.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.000
How did it go?

17:26.160 --> 17:27.720
Did you see Physician Li?

17:29.160 --> 17:31.959
I did, but he was in a hurry to leave.

17:31.960 --> 17:33.399
He hurriedly said

17:33.400 --> 17:35.199
it's normal even if the swelling bursts.

17:35.200 --> 17:37.760
The pathogenic heat
in the body has to come out.

17:37.960 --> 17:39.639
He'll come back tomorrow
to check on her.

17:45.640 --> 17:48.518
Don't worry too much.
She's only had one dose of medicine.

17:48.519 --> 17:50.320
Maybe her fever
will be gone by tomorrow.

17:56.519 --> 17:58.038
Lanxiang.

17:58.039 --> 17:59.199
Young Master is back.

17:59.200 --> 18:00.280
Hurry.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.679
Go on.

18:02.680 --> 18:04.439
I'll take good care of Yuchan.

18:37.319 --> 18:38.480
Just leave the water there.

18:38.599 --> 18:39.439
Yes.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.999
This water was just boiled.

18:44.000 --> 18:45.159
Be careful. It's hot.

19:02.960 --> 19:03.719
Young Master.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.439
Your bath is ready.

19:19.880 --> 19:21.240
Young Lady Du is here.

19:27.000 --> 19:28.240
I'm exhausted.

19:29.480 --> 19:32.439
Hurry and send her away for me.

19:48.680 --> 19:49.800
Young Lady Du.

19:50.119 --> 19:51.599
Is Jinqi here?

19:52.960 --> 19:54.599
Young Master is taking a bath.

19:55.880 --> 19:57.399
If it isn't urgent,

19:57.400 --> 19:59.078
you can come inside and have some tea

19:59.079 --> 20:00.660
while you wait for him to finish bathing.

20:06.960 --> 20:08.879
It's nothing urgent.

20:09.000 --> 20:10.430
It's just that these past two days,

20:10.440 --> 20:12.758
Jinqi has been on leave
from the Shence Garrison.

20:12.759 --> 20:14.479
My brother came to see me today

20:14.480 --> 20:17.558
and brought some things for Jinqi.

20:17.559 --> 20:19.318
He said they were gifts from the men

20:19.319 --> 20:21.040
of the Shence Garrison for Jinqi,

20:21.079 --> 20:23.000
and asked me to pass them on to him.

20:23.359 --> 20:24.639
Thank you, Young Lady Du.

20:28.280 --> 20:29.630
I'll leave you to your work.

20:29.720 --> 20:31.000
I'll be going.

20:32.000 --> 20:33.320
Take care, Young Lady Du.

20:48.872 --> 20:50.470
Young Master wants to turn in early.

20:50.480 --> 20:51.919
Lock the courtyard gate.

20:52.279 --> 20:53.079
All right.

21:18.480 --> 21:19.720
Let's see what they sent.

21:31.480 --> 21:33.119
Some local specialties.

21:33.920 --> 21:36.479
There's wood ear,
dried daylily, and red dates.

21:36.480 --> 21:39.079
The Gastrodia looks like
the most valuable item.

21:42.759 --> 21:44.200
You can decide what to do with them.

21:44.599 --> 21:47.040
When you have time,
prepare some gifts in return.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.800
Nothing expensive,

21:49.000 --> 21:50.399
but make sure they're practical,

21:50.440 --> 21:52.000
things they can use every day.

21:53.119 --> 21:53.879
Yes.

22:09.640 --> 22:11.280
Young Master, aren't you going to bathe?

22:15.880 --> 22:18.838
I poured a whole bucket
of hot water in earlier

22:18.839 --> 22:20.960
to make some splashing sounds.

22:21.279 --> 22:22.079
It's a little hot.

22:25.319 --> 22:26.960
Then I'll get some cold water.

22:31.720 --> 22:33.119
Third Young Lady.

22:38.799 --> 22:40.079
What are you doing here?

22:40.240 --> 22:41.879
Why don't you even have a maid with you?

22:44.720 --> 22:45.919
Jinqi.

22:46.960 --> 22:48.760
I have something to tell you.

22:53.559 --> 22:54.800
Lanxiang, stay.

22:57.640 --> 22:58.760
There's no need to avoid her.

22:58.960 --> 23:00.599
She'll find out sooner or later anyway.

23:10.319 --> 23:11.480
Jinqi.

23:12.160 --> 23:13.280
I...

23:15.319 --> 23:16.800
There's something...

23:17.640 --> 23:19.480
I don't know how to say it.

23:20.000 --> 23:20.999
Jinqi.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.620
Please don't be angry
when you hear this.

23:22.632 --> 23:24.136
You have to believe me.

23:24.599 --> 23:26.879
I'm not jealous of Xiuwan.

23:26.880 --> 23:28.078
I'm not trying to frame her

23:28.079 --> 23:29.639
or deliberately speak ill of her.

23:29.640 --> 23:31.240
I... I...

23:32.559 --> 23:33.320
I...

23:36.680 --> 23:37.439
I...

23:40.559 --> 23:42.679
I...

23:43.599 --> 23:45.200
I...

23:48.119 --> 23:50.280
Of course I believe you.

23:50.680 --> 23:51.879
Don't be afraid.

23:52.119 --> 23:53.280
And don't panic.

23:53.839 --> 23:55.480
Whatever happens,

23:55.640 --> 23:57.159
I'm here for you.

23:59.680 --> 24:00.800
Jinqi.

24:01.880 --> 24:04.639
Today, I accidentally saw something

24:04.640 --> 24:06.159
I shouldn't have seen.

24:06.480 --> 24:07.280
Young Master.

24:18.640 --> 24:20.639
I have something
to take care of right now.

24:20.839 --> 24:22.359
I'll hear you out later.

24:23.319 --> 24:25.399
Have Madam Han
escort Third Young Lady back.

24:25.400 --> 24:26.359
Yes.

24:36.480 --> 24:37.520
Young Master.

24:38.759 --> 24:39.919
Your wound...

24:41.519 --> 24:42.839
It's not my blood.

24:44.280 --> 24:46.550
Following the clues from the household
registers and travel permits,

24:46.568 --> 24:49.050
we traced them all the way
and confirmed it was the Dai family.

24:49.160 --> 24:50.278
However,

24:50.279 --> 24:52.439
they've probably realized
we're investigating them.

24:54.160 --> 24:55.359
I'm afraid

24:56.240 --> 24:57.639
they're about to make a move.

24:59.640 --> 25:01.119
Marquis Yongchang is in danger.

25:09.839 --> 25:11.278
Are you going out, Young Master?

25:11.279 --> 25:12.720
The night curfew has already begun.

25:13.640 --> 25:14.839
Tonight,

25:15.079 --> 25:16.800
I never left Zhichun Hall.

25:21.279 --> 25:22.879
Young Master was tired,

25:22.880 --> 25:25.159
so I helped Young Master
take a hot bath.

25:25.160 --> 25:25.959
After his bath,

25:25.960 --> 25:28.919
Young Master fell asleep and
slept straight through until morning.

25:33.279 --> 25:35.000
You're too clever

25:36.799 --> 25:40.200
to be a maid.

26:12.279 --> 26:14.599
What are you staring at the wall for?

26:14.720 --> 26:15.879
Where's Young Master?

26:17.039 --> 26:18.800
Young Master is still taking a bath.

26:18.920 --> 26:20.239
He said he was tired

26:20.240 --> 26:21.800
and wanted to soak a little longer.

26:22.119 --> 26:23.758
You've had a long day, too, Madam Han.

26:23.759 --> 26:25.470
Baogai has already
prepared some hot water

26:25.480 --> 26:28.000
and had a young maid
carry it to your room.

26:28.240 --> 26:29.078
Don't worry, Madam.

26:29.079 --> 26:30.560
Baogai and I are here.

26:31.799 --> 26:32.879
All right.

26:32.880 --> 26:34.320
Keep an eye on things.

26:34.400 --> 26:35.919
I'll go get some rest then.

28:05.400 --> 28:07.439
By order of the Defense Command,

28:07.759 --> 28:09.439
Duke Xiangguo has ordered

28:10.039 --> 28:11.560
Lin Residence sealed off.

28:11.640 --> 28:13.439
No one is allowed to enter or leave.

28:13.640 --> 28:15.159
Anyone who disobeys

28:15.160 --> 28:16.639
will be killed on the spot.

28:16.759 --> 28:17.599
Seal it.

28:18.100 --> 28:19.700
(Jinling Defense Command)

28:24.119 --> 28:25.399
See what's going on.

28:29.160 --> 28:30.520
It won't open.

28:30.720 --> 28:31.798
- It won't open.
- Why won't the door open?

28:31.799 --> 28:33.518
Head Butler. Someone sealed the gate
from the outside.

28:33.519 --> 28:34.679
We can't open it.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.800
We can't get the gate open.

28:37.480 --> 28:38.879
Climb up and take a look.

28:50.039 --> 28:51.318
Help!

28:51.319 --> 28:52.480
Run!

28:54.160 --> 28:55.399
Help!

28:55.400 --> 28:56.279
Run!

28:56.280 --> 28:58.899
(Jinling Defense Command)

28:58.900 --> 29:01.979
(Glorify the Family Name)

29:01.980 --> 29:03.999
(Yuan Shaohui's Study)

29:04.000 --> 29:06.599
I am Marquis Yongchang,
a title held in perpetuity.

29:06.880 --> 29:08.798
How dare the Dai family

29:08.800 --> 29:09.976
try to assassinate me?

29:10.072 --> 29:11.710
Aren't they afraid of the death penalty?

29:11.720 --> 29:12.959
If we uncover

29:12.960 --> 29:14.520
their collusion with Wo pirates,

29:14.550 --> 29:16.200
that would also be punishable by death.

29:17.039 --> 29:19.518
We still haven't obtained
any conclusive evidence,

29:19.519 --> 29:21.159
but as long as we keep pursuing them,

29:21.319 --> 29:23.079
they'll live in fear day and night.

29:23.119 --> 29:24.879
Only by getting rid of us

29:25.464 --> 29:27.350
can they end this threat
once and for all.

29:27.599 --> 29:30.919
Their actions are despicable,
and their intentions are deadly.

29:36.319 --> 29:38.879
If they would ambush and assassinate me,

29:41.160 --> 29:43.119
how do they plan to deal with you?

29:47.599 --> 29:48.199
Your Lordship.

29:48.200 --> 29:49.480
Jiugao requests an audience.

29:50.720 --> 29:51.679
Let him in.

29:54.759 --> 29:55.518
Your Lordship.

29:55.528 --> 29:56.184
Young Master.

29:56.440 --> 29:59.030
The Imperial Medical Service
reported an epidemic in the residence.

29:59.030 --> 30:00.792
Several people have
already been infected.

30:00.824 --> 30:02.590
For the safety
of everyone else in the city,

30:02.680 --> 30:03.720
Duke Xiangguo ordered

30:03.730 --> 30:05.590
the Commander
of the Central City Patrol Office

30:05.599 --> 30:07.078
to surround Lin Residence with troops.

30:07.079 --> 30:08.479
No one is allowed to enter or leave.

30:08.480 --> 30:12.280
They've... They've already
shot and killed a servant.

30:13.799 --> 30:16.639
For word of the epidemic
to reach Duke Xiangguo so quickly,

30:16.799 --> 30:18.679
Dai Rong must have had a hand in it.

30:19.799 --> 30:22.000
So this is the Dai family's move.

30:22.240 --> 30:25.079
Luckily, I slipped out
of the residence in secret beforehand.

30:25.480 --> 30:29.119
Otherwise,
I'd already be trapped inside.

30:29.680 --> 30:30.720
Nanke.

30:31.519 --> 30:32.318
Young Master.

30:32.319 --> 30:33.439
You're the most skilled.

30:33.440 --> 30:35.608
Find a way to slip back
into the residence unnoticed

30:35.640 --> 30:37.350
and see what
the situation is like inside.

30:37.400 --> 30:38.840
Also tell First Madam not to panic.

30:38.888 --> 30:41.080
I'll find a way to bring
in the best imperial physicians

30:41.128 --> 30:42.830
to examine everyone at Lin Residence.

30:43.160 --> 30:43.960
Yes.

30:50.720 --> 30:52.280
With Lin Residence sealed off,

30:52.808 --> 30:54.030
they won't know for a while

30:54.039 --> 30:55.720
that you're outside.

30:56.839 --> 30:59.200
Why don't I stay in the open
while you remain hidden?

30:59.640 --> 31:00.959
We can work together

31:00.960 --> 31:02.520
and lure the enemy in.

31:02.599 --> 31:04.359
We'll turn
their own scheme against them.

31:06.079 --> 31:07.760
Then we'll catch them in our trap.

31:17.599 --> 31:18.679
If you've been examined,

31:18.680 --> 31:20.599
hurry and get dressed.

31:26.839 --> 31:27.758
What's wrong with her?

31:27.759 --> 31:28.558
Look at her hand.

31:28.559 --> 31:30.240
Keep your voice down.

31:30.960 --> 31:32.078
Look at her body.

31:32.079 --> 31:33.119
Her skin is all ulcerated.

31:34.440 --> 31:36.879
How did Yuchan end up like this?

31:36.880 --> 31:38.118
How could Yuchan...

31:38.119 --> 31:39.919
She... She won't die, will she?

31:39.920 --> 31:41.038
It's terrifying.

31:41.039 --> 31:42.278
Don't talk nonsense.

31:42.279 --> 31:43.720
How could that happen?

31:43.799 --> 31:45.159
But she looks so frightening.

31:45.160 --> 31:46.278
Look at her face and neck.

31:46.279 --> 31:47.800
How did she end up like this?

31:51.079 --> 31:53.839
First Madam
won't just abandon us, will she?

32:06.119 --> 32:07.239
First Madam,

32:07.240 --> 32:08.639
we've checked everyone carefully.

32:08.640 --> 32:12.399
Madam Han, Lanxiang, Gantang, and Baogai

32:12.400 --> 32:14.000
don't have any red rashes.

32:17.880 --> 32:20.879
It seems this epidemic
isn't that contagious.

32:21.599 --> 32:23.399
Gantang and Lanxiang

32:23.400 --> 32:26.119
have been caring for Yuchan
these past two days, and they're fine.

32:29.576 --> 32:30.696
When Yuchan first fell ill,

32:30.728 --> 32:33.230
I thought it was only a pollen rash
or some other minor rash,

32:33.240 --> 32:34.720
nothing serious.

32:34.880 --> 32:35.999
Young Master also told me

32:36.000 --> 32:37.558
not to disturb First Madam

32:37.559 --> 32:40.200
and to let Yuchan recuperate
in the courtyard for a few days.

32:40.599 --> 32:43.078
So I didn't report it
to First Madam right away.

32:43.079 --> 32:45.119
I never expected it to be an epidemic.

32:45.400 --> 32:46.919
It's all my fault.

32:47.119 --> 32:48.720
Please punish me, First Madam.

32:49.176 --> 32:52.264
- Please punish us, First Madam.
- Please punish us, First Madam.

32:53.559 --> 32:56.079
You're part of Zhichun Hall now.

32:56.168 --> 32:57.790
Since Young Master gave the order,

32:57.799 --> 32:59.359
you naturally had to obey.

33:00.000 --> 33:01.439
As for the epidemic,

33:01.440 --> 33:03.040
none of us could have foreseen it.

33:04.720 --> 33:06.079
All of you, get up.

33:06.440 --> 33:08.744
Thank you for sparing us,
First Madam.

33:08.792 --> 33:11.910
- Thank you for sparing us, First Madam.
- Thank you for sparing us, First Madam.

33:15.079 --> 33:16.200
Madam Han.

33:16.590 --> 33:18.504
Take some people
and prepare all the rooms

33:18.552 --> 33:20.320
in Zhichun Hall as quickly as possible.

33:20.599 --> 33:22.720
This is no time to be particular.

33:22.799 --> 33:24.919
As long as they're
habitable, they'll do.

33:25.599 --> 33:26.520
Yes.

33:28.799 --> 33:29.278
Baogai.

33:29.279 --> 33:30.518
Take Hongliao

33:30.519 --> 33:32.278
and prepare the east wing.

33:32.279 --> 33:33.439
Lanxiang, Gantang.

33:33.440 --> 33:35.359
Come with me to prepare the west wing.

33:45.599 --> 33:47.919
- Mother.
- First Madam.

33:48.359 --> 33:49.798
As you instructed,

33:49.799 --> 33:50.639
we checked everyone

33:50.640 --> 33:51.919
in Yujiao Garden.

33:51.920 --> 33:53.479
No one has developed a red rash.

33:53.480 --> 33:55.159
We've already locked the courtyard gate.

33:55.288 --> 33:57.176
(Wei, Qin's first-class maid)
Here's the key.

33:57.480 --> 33:58.879
Keep it safe.

33:58.880 --> 34:01.439
The gate may only be opened
each day when meals are delivered.

34:01.440 --> 34:02.560
Yes.

34:12.880 --> 34:14.320
- Mother.
- Aunt Shunhua.

34:14.792 --> 34:15.976
Given the circumstances,

34:16.008 --> 34:18.168
it'll be easier for everyone
to look after one another.

34:18.184 --> 34:20.750
For the time being, you'll have
to put up with some inconvenience

34:20.760 --> 34:22.600
and all stay at Zhichun Hall.

34:22.610 --> 34:24.790
(Tan Suhua, Lin Jinlan's wife)
Once the epidemic is over,

34:24.800 --> 34:26.640
you can move back.

34:26.960 --> 34:28.039
Yes.

34:28.280 --> 34:29.839
Shunhua.

34:30.480 --> 34:31.640
Shunhua.

34:35.039 --> 34:36.959
Everything was perfectly fine.

34:37.079 --> 34:39.399
How did an epidemic suddenly break out?

34:43.360 --> 34:44.319
I'm telling you,

34:44.320 --> 34:45.439
in my courtyard alone,

34:45.440 --> 34:47.959
four people were found with rashes.

34:57.599 --> 34:59.238
Didn't I tell you

34:59.239 --> 35:01.078
to bring only your personal attendants

35:01.079 --> 35:03.319
and pack only a few daily necessities?

35:03.320 --> 35:05.879
Why did you bring so many people
and so much luggage?

35:07.519 --> 35:08.879
It was my fault.

35:08.920 --> 35:10.718
I didn't explain it clearly
to Second Madam.

35:10.719 --> 35:13.120
Nanxing, Yinxian, and Lingdang, stay.

35:13.280 --> 35:15.519
Everyone else, go back.

35:17.960 --> 35:19.080
Go on.

35:23.239 --> 35:26.120
In the outer residence,
except for Old Master, Old Madam,

35:26.159 --> 35:28.598
and Fourth Young Master,
who lives with them,

35:28.599 --> 35:30.439
everyone else, without exception,

35:30.440 --> 35:32.120
must remain in the inner residence.

35:33.519 --> 35:35.598
Yuchan, Jinqi's senior maid,

35:35.599 --> 35:37.319
Madam Wu from my household,

35:37.320 --> 35:39.238
Second Young Lady's
wet nurse, Madam Zhou,

35:39.239 --> 35:41.118
and the other servants
who have fallen ill

35:41.119 --> 35:43.399
have all been moved
to Fengqi Courtyard for isolation.

35:44.400 --> 35:45.799
From now on,

35:45.800 --> 35:47.800
no one is to move
about without permission.

35:47.920 --> 35:50.039
Every courtyard will be locked.

35:51.159 --> 35:52.399
The gates may only be opened

35:52.400 --> 35:53.800
when meals are delivered.

35:59.519 --> 36:00.479
Shunhua.

36:00.480 --> 36:01.919
Are you staying here, too?

36:02.599 --> 36:03.999
Xiushu is ill.

36:04.000 --> 36:06.320
I have to return
to Rongzhang House to care for her.

36:07.320 --> 36:09.198
If anyone else falls ill,

36:09.200 --> 36:11.384
members of the family
will be moved to Rongzhang House

36:11.416 --> 36:12.590
to stay with us.

36:12.599 --> 36:15.479
The maids and nannies
will go to Fengqi Courtyard.

36:19.400 --> 36:20.800
Where's Jinqi?

36:27.840 --> 36:28.959
Yes.

36:29.440 --> 36:30.718
Where is your Young Master?

36:30.719 --> 36:32.439
Why haven't we seen him all this time?

36:33.079 --> 36:34.439
Young Master...

36:43.480 --> 36:45.240
Young Master isn't at Zhichun Hall.

36:48.440 --> 36:49.559
What?

36:49.920 --> 36:52.080
You're saying Jinqi isn't here?

36:52.239 --> 36:53.120
Then...

36:53.199 --> 36:54.359
where did he go?

36:54.360 --> 36:55.640
Where did he go?

36:56.440 --> 36:59.439
Before the night curfew tonight,
a friend came looking for Jinqi,

36:59.440 --> 37:01.080
so he went out.

37:01.128 --> 37:02.750
Now that the residence has been sealed,

37:02.760 --> 37:05.479
he couldn't come back
even if he wanted to.

37:06.719 --> 37:07.959
At a time like this,

37:07.960 --> 37:09.399
Jinqi isn't here.

37:10.440 --> 37:11.359
Jinqi isn't here.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.959
What are we going to do?

37:12.960 --> 37:14.200
What are we going to do?

37:24.840 --> 37:25.720
This...

37:26.840 --> 37:28.559
What are we going to do?

37:48.880 --> 37:50.680
Given the situation,

37:50.800 --> 37:53.600
it's definitely better
that Jinqi is outside.

37:54.280 --> 37:56.479
No one in the entire residence
is allowed to leave now.

37:56.480 --> 37:59.359
Even friends and relatives
would find it hard to help.

37:59.480 --> 38:00.799
With Jinqi outside,

38:00.800 --> 38:03.479
he can make arrangements on our behalf

38:03.920 --> 38:06.519
and seek help
from the Imperial Medical Service.

38:07.239 --> 38:08.320
That's right.

38:10.079 --> 38:11.959
I really was confused.

38:11.960 --> 38:13.640
You see things more clearly.

38:13.960 --> 38:15.638
With Jinqi's abilities,

38:15.639 --> 38:17.399
I'm sure it won't be long

38:17.400 --> 38:19.038
before all those soldiers outside

38:19.039 --> 38:20.879
are withdrawn.

38:20.880 --> 38:22.240
They'll all be withdrawn.

38:22.456 --> 38:24.590
If Jinqi were here,
he would naturally be in charge.

38:24.599 --> 38:25.959
But now that he isn't,

38:25.960 --> 38:27.680
and First Madam
isn't staying here either,

38:27.719 --> 38:30.640
with so many people in this courtyard,
someone has to take charge.

38:31.039 --> 38:32.518
Since Jinqi isn't here,

38:32.519 --> 38:34.640
Jinlan should naturally take charge.

38:37.780 --> 38:40.078
(Zhou Guizhi, Lin Changzheng's
concubine and Lin Jinlan's mother)

38:40.079 --> 38:41.320
First Madam.

38:41.480 --> 38:44.240
I know Jinlan is capable,

38:44.440 --> 38:46.559
but with so many people to worry about,

38:47.480 --> 38:49.600
I'm afraid it may be too much for him.

38:52.880 --> 38:55.080
Madam Han and Lanxiang

38:55.119 --> 38:57.479
are the people Jinqi relies on most.

38:59.880 --> 39:00.999
Jinlan,

39:01.320 --> 39:02.919
you just need to oversee things.

39:03.039 --> 39:05.959
Leave the actual work to Madam Han

39:05.960 --> 39:07.839
and Lanxiang.

39:10.760 --> 39:12.240
Then it's settled.

39:22.159 --> 39:23.240
First Madam.

39:32.760 --> 39:34.238
I've studied medicine for many years.

39:34.239 --> 39:35.680
I wouldn't claim to have mastered it,

39:35.840 --> 39:37.800
but I do know a fair amount.

39:38.320 --> 39:39.816
Xiushu is ill now,

39:39.848 --> 39:42.530
and the imperial physicians won't
be able to get in anytime soon.

39:42.616 --> 39:44.590
Why don't I go examine Xiushu

39:44.599 --> 39:46.080
and the other patients?

39:46.320 --> 39:49.598
That way, I can
at least ease their suffering

39:49.599 --> 39:51.200
and slow the progression of the illness.

39:57.039 --> 40:00.080
True gold is tested by fire,
and true courage by adversity.

40:00.199 --> 40:01.759
Others flee at the mere mention

40:01.760 --> 40:03.198
of an epidemic.

40:03.199 --> 40:05.320
You are truly a heroine.

40:06.840 --> 40:07.919
Indeed.

40:08.559 --> 40:11.038
Young Lady Du's sincerity is admirable.

40:11.039 --> 40:11.839
Shunhua.

40:11.840 --> 40:13.720
Let her go see Xiushu.

40:21.440 --> 40:22.559
Then...

40:36.280 --> 40:37.720
Is it this kind?

40:39.920 --> 40:42.280
This is a larkspur
flower ornament I made.

40:42.480 --> 40:44.118
Since larkspur shares my name,

40:44.119 --> 40:45.800
I made a few extra

40:45.840 --> 40:47.959
to wear from time to time.

40:48.119 --> 40:49.760
How did this get here?

40:57.159 --> 40:58.558
It's late.

40:58.559 --> 40:59.760
You're tired, too.

41:00.039 --> 41:01.439
Let's all get some sleep.

41:02.000 --> 41:03.240
Tomorrow,

41:03.400 --> 41:04.359
we'll see

41:04.760 --> 41:07.680
what the Defense Command plans to do.

41:07.760 --> 41:10.760
Perhaps the imperial physicians
will come by then.

41:17.039 --> 41:18.519
First Madam is right.

42:04.320 --> 42:05.439
Gantang.

42:07.480 --> 42:08.680
Second Madam.

42:08.920 --> 42:10.120
This way, please.

42:13.920 --> 42:15.320
We'll share a room.

42:20.648 --> 42:22.424
Second Young Master. Third Young Master.

42:22.456 --> 42:24.760
Please follow me.

42:25.360 --> 42:26.559
I'm exhausted.

42:26.920 --> 42:28.319
Luckily, I've already washed up.

42:28.320 --> 42:29.720
I can go straight to bed.

42:42.920 --> 42:43.999
Third Young Lady.

42:44.000 --> 42:45.760
I'll show you to your room.

42:48.360 --> 42:49.280
All right.

42:49.480 --> 42:50.680
Thank you.

42:51.360 --> 42:52.919
You're welcome, Third Young Lady.

43:04.980 --> 43:07.820
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:15.400 --> 43:16.879
Lingdang.

43:17.880 --> 43:19.519
Lingdang.

43:22.199 --> 43:24.320
Lingdang.

43:34.079 --> 43:37.839
Lingdang! How did this happen?

43:38.559 --> 43:40.839
My poor Lingdang.

43:41.079 --> 43:41.999
Lingdang.

43:43.400 --> 43:44.759
Lingdang, hold on.

43:44.760 --> 43:45.759
Lingdang.

43:45.760 --> 43:47.240
I can save you.

43:47.760 --> 43:48.839
Lingdang!

44:06.140 --> 44:10.260
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:13.100 --> 44:17.620
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:18.900 --> 44:22.820
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:23.500 --> 44:26.260
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:26.980 --> 44:29.300
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:29.300 --> 44:32.380
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:33.900 --> 44:38.140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:41.060 --> 44:45.220
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:47.020 --> 44:50.580
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:50.580 --> 44:54.140
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:54.940 --> 45:00.620
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

45:00.980 --> 45:05.300
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:05.660 --> 45:08.620
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:08.620 --> 45:12.380
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:12.380 --> 45:15.260
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:15.260 --> 45:19.340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:19.340 --> 45:22.700
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:22.700 --> 45:26.460
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:26.460 --> 45:30.460
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:31.220 --> 45:35.380
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:35.380 --> 45:38.820
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:38.820 --> 45:42.460
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:42.460 --> 45:45.340
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:45.340 --> 45:49.420
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:49.420 --> 45:52.780
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:52.780 --> 45:56.420
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:56.420 --> 46:04.220
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
